# Environment variables for ui-registry (docker-container)
# Generated by genproj. Copy to `.env` next to docker-compose.yml and fill in
# real values (genproj never commits secrets).
#
# Keys are derived from the docker-container `envVars` configuration; nothing
# is invented here.

# NB_REGISTRY_TOKEN is NO LONGER USED (2026-11-14). The registry endpoint is
# public: `shadcn-svelte@1.8.1` sends no auth headers, so a gated registry is
# unconsumable by the only CLI that reads it. The secret still exists in Doppler
# `common` but nothing reads it here; do not wire it back in unless a client
# that can send a header arrives first. See README "Registry".
# NB_REGISTRY_TOKEN=
